{"sha": "8fbe32cbc7d7592cb113bfbd303fd1955957ffdbab9f3dac62967d76baad72c1", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:powerseries} 章 --- 幂级数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:1}", "$\\sum \\frac{n^2}{2^n}z^n$：比值 $\\frac{(n+1)^2}{2^{n+1}}\\cdot", "\\frac{2^n}{n^2} \\to \\frac12$：$R = 2$。", "", "$\\sum \\frac{z^n}{\\binom{2n}{n}}$：$\\binom{2n}{n} \\sim", "\\frac{4^n}{\\sqrt{\\pi n}}$（\\cref{ex:b2:comparison:centralbinomial}），", "故 $\\abs{a_n}^{-1} \\approx 4^n$（相差多项式因子）：$R = 4$", "（比值判别法：$\\frac{\\binom{2n}{n}}{\\binom{2n+2}{n+1}} =", "\\frac{(n+1)^2}{(2n+1)(2n+2)} \\to \\frac14$）。", "", "$\\sum z^{n!}$：系数 $a_k = 1$（若 $k = n!$），否则为 $0$。对于", "$\\abs z < 1$ 时，$\\sum \\abs z^{n!}$ 收敛（由几何级数控制）；", "当 $\\abs z \\geq 1$ 时，通项不趋于 $0$：$R = 1$。", "", "$\\sum (2 + (-1)^n)^n z^n$：系数为 $3^n$（$n$ 为偶数）与 $1$", "（$n$ 为奇数）。要使 $a_nr^n$ 有界，需 $3r \\leq 1$；而 $r <", "\\frac13$ 即可：$R = \\frac13$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:2}", "三者的收敛半径均为 $1$（比值判别法）。在 $z = 1$ 处：$\\sum 1$", "发散；$\\sum\\frac1n$ 发散；$\\sum\\frac{1}{n^2}$ 收敛。在", "$z = -1$ 处：$\\sum(-1)^n$ 发散；$\\sum\\frac{(-1)^n}{n}$ 收敛", "（交错级数）；$\\sum\\frac{(-1)^n}{n^2}$ 绝对收敛。", "收敛半径看不出边界处的情形。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:3}", "由 $\\frac{1}{1-x} = \\sum x^n$，逐项求导并乘以 $x$", "（\\cref{thm:b2:powerseries:calculus}）：", "\\[", "\\sum n x^n = \\frac{x}{(1-x)^2} .", "\\]", "再求一次导，再乘以 $x$：", "\\[", "\\sum n^2 x^n = x\\,\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd x}\\Bigl(\\frac{x}{(1-x)^2}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{x(1 + x)}{(1-x)^3} .", "\\]", "第三个和式是 $-\\ln(1 - x)$ 的奇次项部分：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n\\geq0} \\frac{x^{2n+1}}{2n+1}", "= \\frac{-\\ln(1-x) + \\ln(1+x)}{2}", "= \\frac12 \\ln\\frac{1+x}{1-x}", "= \\operatorname{artanh} x .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:4}", "部分分式：$\\frac{1}{(1-x)(2-x)} = \\frac{1}{1-x} -", "\\frac{1}{2 - x} = \\sum x^n - \\frac12\\sum \\bigl(\\frac x2\\bigr)^n$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{(1-x)(2-x)} = \\sum_{n\\geq0} \\Bigl(1 -", "\\frac{1}{2^{n+1}}\\Bigr)x^n,", "\\qquad R = 1 .", "\\]", "", "$\\ln(1 + x + x^2) = \\ln\\frac{1 - x^3}{1 - x} = \\ln(1 - x^3) -", "\\ln(1 - x) = \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{x^n}{n} -", "\\sum_{m\\geq1}\\frac{x^{3m}}{m}$：$x^n$ 的系数为", "$\\frac1n$（$3 \\nmid n$ 时），而 $\\frac1n - \\frac{3}{n} = -\\frac2n$（", "$3 \\mid n$ 时）。收敛半径为 $1$（最近的奇点来自", "$\\ln(1-x^3)$ 的级数）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:5}", "$\\sum_{m \\geq 0} x^m$（系数为 $1$）与", "$\\sum_{k\\geq1} \\frac{x^k}{k}$（系数为 $\\frac1k$，$k \\geq", "1$）的柯西乘积，二者在 $\\abs x < 1$ 时绝对收敛，其乘积中", "$x^n$ 的系数为 $\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac1k \\cdot 1 = H_n$。", "由此", "\\[", "\\Bigl(\\sum x^m\\Bigr)\\Bigl(\\sum \\frac{x^k}{k}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1}{1-x}\\cdot\\bigl(-\\ln(1-x)\\bigr)", "= \\sum_{n\\geq1} H_n x^n .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:6}", "将递推式两边乘以 $x^{n+1}$ 并求和（$\\abs x <", "\\frac12$）：", "\\[", "U(x) - 1 = 2x\\,U(x) + \\sum_{n\\geq0} n\\,x^{n+1}", "= 2x\\,U(x) + \\frac{x^2}{(1-x)^2} ,", "\\]", "利用\\cref{exo:b2:powerseries:3}，于是", "\\[", "U(x) = \\frac{1}{1 - 2x}\\Bigl(1 + \\frac{x^2}{(1-x)^2}\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{1 - 2x + 2x^2}{(1-2x)(1-x)^2} .", "\\]", "部分分式（用遮盖法，在 $x = \\frac12$ 处得系数 $2$；", "在二重极点 $x = 1$ 处系数为 $-1$；中间", "项系数在 $x = 0$ 处取值即为零）：", "\\[", "U(x) = \\frac{2}{1-2x} - \\frac{1}{(1 - x)^2} .", "\\]", "将两项分别展开：", "\\[", "u_n = 2\\cdot 2^n - (n + 1) = 2^{n+1} - n - 1 .", "\\]", "（验算：$u_0 = 1$，$u_1 = 2u_0 + 0 = 2 = 4 - 2$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:powerseries:7}", "归纳法：$f'(x) = \\frac{2}{x^3}\\eu^{-1/x^2}$，若 $f^{(n)}(x)", "= P_n(\\tfrac1x)\\eu^{-1/x^2}$，则", "\\[", "f^{(n+1)}(x) =", "\\Bigl(-\\frac{1}{x^2}\\,P_n'\\Bigl(\\frac1x\\Bigr) +", "\\frac{2}{x^3}\\,P_n\\Bigl(\\frac1x\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\eu^{-1/x^2} :", "\\]", "仍为上述形式。在 $0$ 处，差商 $\\frac{f^{(n)}(h)}{h} =", "\\frac1h P_n(\\frac1h)\\eu^{-1/h^2} \\to 0$，当 $h \\to 0$ 时，由于", "$Q(u)\\,\\eu^{-u^2} \\to 0$（$u \\to \\pm\\infty$），对任意多项式", "$Q$ 均成立（指数衰减胜过任何多项式）：由归纳法，所有 $f^{(n)}(0)$ 存在", "且都为零，每个 $f^{(n)}$ 在 $0$ 处由同一极限", "可知连续。故 $f \\in C^\\infty$，且在 $0$ 处泰勒级数为零；", "其和为 $0 \\neq f$，故在 $0$ 处不解析。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}